  "description": "ToolUp.AssetStore — image-first asset substrate for ToolUp.Platform. Per-asset records with alt-text required at upload, content-hash-keyed derivative cache (thumbnail / medium / OG-image / WebP / AVIF), pluggable IDerivativeRenderer (default: SkiaSharp). Wraps IBlobStorage for originals + derivative cache. Audit emission via IAuditLog under _platform.assets.",
